# GrantScope needs NO credentials and NO environment variables at runtime.
#
# It is a purely offline static analyser: it reads local files, never opens a
# network connection, and never verifies JWT signatures. Do NOT put OAuth
# client secrets, access tokens or provider API keys in this project.
#
# Optional developer conveniences only:
#
#   GRANTSCOPE_PROFILE=default     # or "mcp" (same as --profile mcp)
#   PYTHONPATH=.                  # only needed when running from a checkout
#
# If you want to inspect a live authorization server, capture its artefacts
# yourself into files first (for example with curl -i), then audit those files:
#
#   curl -s https://id.example.com/.well-known/openid-configuration \
#     > examples/mine/discovery.json
#   curl -si -X POST https://id.example.com/token ... \
#     > examples/mine/headers.http
#   python -m grantscope audit examples/mine --profile mcp
